ful cry","transliteration":"l-ṣayḥatu","verse_key":"15:83"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُصْبِحِينَ","en_gloss":"(at) early morning","transliteration":"muṣ'biḥīna","verse_key":"15:83"},{"pos":4,"ar":"٨٣","en_gloss":"(83)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"15:83"}]},{"verse_key":"15:84","surah":15,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"فَمَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"What they had gained was of no use to them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"15:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَغْنَىٰ","en_gloss":"availed","transliteration":"aghnā","verse_key":"15:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنْهُم","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"15:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"15:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used (to)","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"15:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَكْسِبُونَ","en_gloss":"earn","transliteration":"yaksibūna","verse_key":"15:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"15:84"}]},{"verse_key":"15:85","surah":15,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا خَلَقْنَا ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَآ إِلَّا بِٱلْحَقِّ ۗ وَإِنَّ ٱلسَّاعَةَ لَـَٔاتِيَةٌ ۖ فَٱصْفَحِ ٱلصَّفْحَ ٱلْجَمِيلَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We did not create the heavens and the earth and everything between them without a true purpose: the Hour will certainly come, so [Prophet] bear with them graciously.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"15:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","en_gloss":"We created","transliteration":"khalaqnā","verse_key":"15:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"15:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"15:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"15:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْ